title: Build an Electoral Committee
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: electoral_committee_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; electoral_committee_timer += 5

= Build an Electoral Committee

Candidate reports, constituency contacts, complaints, and legal questions need
somewhere to go. The committee cannot guarantee honest elections, but it can make
the coalition less dependent on rumor.

- @collect_reports: Collect constituency reports
- @legal_case: Prepare constitutional and legal arguments

@collect_reports
on-arrival: organizational_reach += 5; political_intelligence += 5; resources -= 1
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough organizational resources.
go-to: post_event

The secretariat begins keeping a common record of local contacts and election
complaints.

@legal_case
on-arrival: constitutional_legitimacy += 5; political_intelligence += 2; iran_party_relation += 2
go-to: post_event

Lawyers and deputies begin organizing the coalition's constitutional case.
